Hover X1 is an exclusive app for Hover Camera X1. You can preview the shooting in real time and lock the shooting details; the camera parameter adjustment function brings various gameplay, and there is also a video material management function to create your exclusive  library for photogenic spot.

Function introduction:
-【Real-time preview】Real-time preview of the  shooting ,check the quality and content at any time;
-【Camera parameter adjustment】arbitrary adjustment of the camera's flight angle, distance and tracking form, and shoot more freely.
-【Video/Photo mode】Single mode/continuous mode can be switched during the shooting process, to freeze every wonderful moments;
-【Material Management】One-click film maker, saving time and efficiency, and sharing one step faster.
